<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Contact Us — LifeWebLab</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; background: #ffffff; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    header { border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; padding: 18px 20px; }
    .header-inner { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    .logo { text-decoration: none; font-size: 1.45rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; }
    .nav-link { text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b; }
    .nav-link:hover { color: #2563eb; }
    main { max-width: 860px; margin: 50px auto 80px auto; padding: 0 20px; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 24px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    p { font-size: 1.05rem; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 18px; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }
    .contact-card { background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px; margin-top: 24px; }
    .contact-item { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600; }
    .contact-item a { color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none; }
    footer { border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo">🧪 LifeWebLab</a>
      <a href="/" class="nav-link">← Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main>
    <h1>Contact Us</h1>
    <p>Have an inquiry, technical question, or partnership suggestion? We welcome feedback and collaboration from our global readers.</p>
    
    <div class="contact-card">
      <p class="contact-item">📧 Email Inquiry: <a href="mailto:contact@lifeweblab.com">contact@lifeweblab.com</a></p>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #64748b;">We typically respond to inquiries within 24 to 48 business hours.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 LifeWebLab. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
